# Flash path

Before changing write/unlock/verify/Go/FCMD code, read `.cursor/skills/sam4l-samba-flash/SKILL.md`.

- Do not add another settle/reopen/skip-unlock experiment.
- Drive the official SAM-BA 2.16/2.18 SAM4L applet, or stop and name the missing evidence.
- Never write below `0x4000`. Never Erase All.
- Do not flash `hp15c-firmware-2.bin`.
